<title>FINLAND: RAUTE WINS FIM 80 MLN ORDER TO INDONESIA.</title>
<headline>RAUTE WINS FIM 80 MLN ORDER TO INDONESIA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wood industry machinery maker Raute Oy said on Tuesday it had won a plant order worth about 80 million markka from the Indonesian company Surya Dumai.</p>
<p>&quot;The delivery will take place in 1997,&quot; Raute said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
